@startuml
title Handling an incident
|Monitoring|
start
:Alert fires;
|On call|
:Acknowledge;
if (customers affected?) then (yes)
  :Open an incident;
elseif (data at risk?) then (yes)
  :Call the security team;
else (no)
  :Fix it in working hours;
  stop
endif
fork
  :Find the cause;
fork again
  |Support|
  :Post a status update;
end fork
|On call|
repeat
  :Try a fix;
  :Watch the graphs;
repeat while (still broken?) is (yes) not (no)
|Support|
:Tell the customers;
|On call|
:Write the review;
note right
  blameless,
  within two days
end note
stop
@enduml
